# XILINDRO alone in the Corrigida's easy opponent (`fight_easy_ai`, docs/fights/EASY_AI.md):
# a decent player: answers each tell 250-350 ms after it shows and kicks while the opponent is open.
# The bot (`core/fight_bot.zig`, `--fight-bot PROFILE,SEED`) plays the round
# itself through the arena's key handler, seeing only the screen and never the
# opponent's AI; the run is deterministic. Seed 1: won by the 90-s clock, the
